{"id":"wa_hrend","lemma":"während","pos":"conj","rank":364,"glosses":["while (at the same time as)","whereas, while (in contrast to)"],"ipa":"/ˈvɛːʁənt/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/d6/De-w%C3%A4hrend2.ogg/De-w%C3%A4hrend2.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Sei ruhig während der Stunde.","en":"Be quiet during the lesson.","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"sein"},{"g":"quietly"},null,{"g":"the"},{"g":"hour"}]},{"text":"Seid still, während wir essen.","en":"Be quiet while we're eating.","words":[{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"quiet, silent"},null,{"g":"we"},{"g":"to eat"}]},{"text":"Während einige fragen \"Warum?\", fragen andere \"Warum nicht?\".","en":"While some ask why, others ask why not.","words":[null,{"g":"united","l":"einig"},{"g":"to ask"},{"g":"why"},{"g":"to ask"},{"g":"another , others","l":"anderer"},{"g":"why"},{"g":"not"}]},{"text":"Waren Kunden da, während ich weg war?","en":"Were there any customers while I was gone?","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"sein"},{"g":"customer","l":"Kunde"},{"g":"there"},null,{"g":"I"},{"g":"away"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"}]},{"text":"Ruhe dich aus, während ich fahre.","en":"You rest while I drive.","words":[{"g":"calm"},{"g":"you","l":"du"},{"g":"out of / from"},null,{"g":"I"},{"g":"to go at speed","l":"fahren"}]}]}